<title>USA: Fannie Mae to redeem $600 mln 2002 issue.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to redeem $600 mln 2002 issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae on Friday said that on June 10 it will redeem the entire $600 million principal amount of its 6.80 percent debentures that are due June 10, 2002. Cusip number is SM-2002-F.</p>
<p>Fannie Mae originally issued the debentures on June 10, 1992.</p>
<p>The redemption price of the debentures will be 100 percent of the principal amount plus interest accrued to the redemption date, Fannie Mae said.</p>
</text>
